ex:A_job_requires_12_CPUs_12_tasks_and_1_CPU_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Allocate_CPUs_using_the_minimum_number_of_nodes_and_the_minimum_number_of_sockets_required_for_the_job_in_order_to_minimize_fragmentation_of_allocated_unallocated_CPUs_in_the_cluster a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 12 CPUs (12 tasks and 1 CPU per task with no overcommitment). Allocate CPUs using the minimum number of nodes and the minimum number of sockets required for the job in order to minimize fragmentation of allocated/unallocated CPUs in the cluster." .

ex:A_job_requires_12_CPUs_6_tasks_and_2_CPUs_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Allocate_6_CPUs_each_from_2_nodes_in_the_default_partition_Distribute_tasks_to_nodes_cyclically a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 12 CPUs (6 tasks and 2 CPUs per task with no overcommitment). Allocate 6 CPUs each from 2 nodes in the default partition. Distribute tasks to nodes cyclically." .

ex:A_job_requires_16_CPUs_8_tasks_and_2_CPUs_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Use_all_3_nodes_in_the_default_partition_Distribute_tasks_to_each_node_in_blocks_of_two_in_a_round_robin_fashion a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 16 CPUs (8 tasks and 2 CPUs per task with no overcommitment). Use all 3 nodes in the default partition. Distribute tasks to each node in blocks of two in a round-robin fashion." .

ex:A_job_requires_18_CPUs_18_tasks_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_the_default_partition_Allocate_6_CPUs_on_each_node_using_block_allocation_within_nodes_Use_cyclic_distribution_of_tasks_to_nodes_and_block_distribution_of_tasks_for_CPU_binding a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 18 CPUs (18 tasks with no overcommitment). Run the job in the default partition. Allocate 6 CPUs on each node using block allocation within nodes. Use cyclic distribution of tasks to nodes and block distribution of tasks for CPU binding." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_2_tasks_and_3_CPUs_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Allocate_the_6_CPUs_as_consumable_resources_from_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (2 tasks and 3 CPUs per task with no overcommitment). Allocate the 6 CPUs as consumable resources from a single node in the default partition." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_2_tasks_with_3_cpus_per_task_and_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition_Allocate_cores_using_the_block_allocation_method_Distribute_cores_using_the_block_distribution_method_Apply_socket_binding_to_each_task a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (2 tasks with 3 cpus per task and no overcommitment). Run the job in a single node in the default partition. Allocate cores using the block allocation method. Distribute cores using the block distribution method. Apply socket binding to each task." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_2_tasks_with_3_cpus_per_task_and_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition_Allocate_cores_using_the_block_allocation_method_Distribute_cores_using_the_cyclic_distribution_method_Apply_socket_binding_to_each_task a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (2 tasks with 3 cpus per task and no overcommitment). Run the job in a single node in the default partition. Allocate cores using the block allocation method. Distribute cores using the cyclic distribution method. Apply socket binding to each task." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_6_tasks_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (6 tasks with no overcommitment). Run the job in a single node in the default partition." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_6_tasks_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition_Apply_core_binding_to_each_task a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (6 tasks with no overcommitment). Run the job in a single node in the default partition. Apply core binding to each task." .

ex:A_job_requires_6_CPUs_6_tasks_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_a_single_node_in_the_default_partition_Apply_socket_binding_to_each_task a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 6 CPUs (6 tasks with no overcommitment). Run the job in a single node in the default partition. Apply socket binding to each task." .

ex:A_job_requires_8_CPUs_8_tasks_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_on_node_n3_allocating_only_one_thread_per_core a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 8 CPUs (8 tasks with no overcommitment). Run the job on node n3, allocating only one thread per core." .

ex:A_job_requires_9_CPUs_3_tasks_and_3_CPUs_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Allocate_3_CPUs_from_each_of_the_3_nodes_in_the_default_partition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 9 CPUs (3 tasks and 3 CPUs per task with no overcommitment). Allocate 3 CPUs from each of the 3 nodes in the default partition." .

ex:A_job_requires_9_CPUs_3_tasks_and_3_CPUs_per_task_with_no_overcommitment_Run_the_job_in_the_default_partition_managing_the_CPUs_to_optimize_the_performance_of_the_job a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "A job requires 9 CPUs (3 tasks and 3 CPUs per task with no overcommitment). Run the job in the default partition, managing the CPUs to optimize the performance of the job." .

