ex:JobCompType_controls_how_job_completion_information_is_recorded_This_can_be_used_to_record_basic_job_information_such_as_job_name_user_name_allocated_nodes_start_time_completion_time_exit_status_etc_If_the_preservation_of_only_basic_job_information_is_required_this_plugin_should_satisfy_your_needs_with_minimal_overhead_You_can_store_this_information_in_a_text_file_or_MySQL_or_MariaDB_database a owl:Class ;
