ex:Note_In_most_cases_removed_entities_are_preserved_in_the_slurm_database_but_flagged_as_deleted_If_an_entity_has_existed_for_less_than_1_day_the_entity_will_be_removed_completely_This_is_meant_to_clean_up_after_typographical_errors_Removing_user_associations_or_accounts_however_will_cause_slurmctld_to_lose_track_of_usage_data_for_that_user_account a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Note: In most cases, removed entities are preserved in the slurm database, but flagged as deleted. If an entity has existed for less than 1 day, the entity will be removed completely. This is meant to clean up after typographical errors. Removing user associations or accounts, however, will cause slurmctld to lose track of usage data for that user/account." .

